<title>FRANCE: France's de Charette to make eastern tour.</title>
<headline>France's de Charette to make eastern tour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Foreign Minister Herve de Charette will visit Azerbaijan, Armenia and Turkey from April 1 to April 3, a foreign ministry spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Spokesman Jacques Rummelhardt told reporters at a regular news briefing the tour was aimed at strengthening France's ties with the three countries.</p>
</text>
